OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures announced for Nagar
OL,4,AKirtan procession
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people will walk through
OL,7,FLeicester as part of a major Sikh
OL,8,Ffestival to celebrate the birth of the
OL,9,Freligion's first Guru and founder,
OL,10,FNanak Dev Ji.
OL,12,FThe Nagar Kirtan procession will be
OL,13,Fheld on 15 November to mark one of the
OL,14,Fbiggest events in the Leicester Sikh
OL,15,Fcommunity's calendar.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
