OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures announced for Nagar
OL,4,AKirtan procession
OL,5,
OL,6,FRolling road blocks will be in place
OL,7,Fduring the event, where worshippers
OL,8,Fwill walk from the Guru Tegh Bahadur
OL,9,FGurdwara, in East Park Road, at about
OL,10,F11:30 GMT to the Guru Nanak Gurdwara,
OL,11,Fin Holy Bones Road, near St Nicholas
OL,12,FCircle.
OL,14,FLeicester City Council said some bus
OL,15,Foperators would also follow alternative
OL,16,Froutes for a short time as the
OL,17,Fprocession made its way across the
OL,18,Fcity.
